{"id":"6f6b2f3565aebf58","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset.md","title":"ZFC Top3 Clopen Subset","display":"df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset — ZFC Top3 Clopen Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset — ZFC Top3 Clopen Subset","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-top3-open-subset]]","[[58-df-zfc-top3-closed-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset — ZFC Top3 Clopen Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55b1c55050617b61\" href=\"?note=55b1c55050617b61\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top3-open-subset\">58-df-zfc-top3-open-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"821df71c85e5effd\" href=\"?note=821df71c85e5effd\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top3-closed-subset\">58-df-zfc-top3-closed-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,C\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3OpenSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClosedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3OpenSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClosedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}clopen\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop3OpenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClosedSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}clopen\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop3OpenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClosedSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both conjuncts use the same carrier and topology, so the predicate cannot mix openness and closedness from different ambient spaces.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-top3-open-subset","status":"resolved","id":"55b1c55050617b61","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top3-open-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top3-closed-subset","status":"resolved","id":"821df71c85e5effd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top3-closed-subset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3OpenSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClosedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}clopen\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop3OpenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClosedSubset}_S(X,\\tau,C)","display":true}],"bytes":945,"backlinks":[{"id":"da2c915c953b62ca","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (canonical clopen-subset predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset.md]])"},{"id":"b49399dd5e084e77","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S$ (clopen-subset predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset]])"},{"id":"00c260c08fea6762","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3549","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset.md|58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["55b1c55050617b61","821df71c85e5effd"]}